ity** — Can this be replicated? Missing details?\n5. **Weaknesses** — What are the methodological weaknesses?\n6. **Strengths** — What works well?\n\n## Output format\n\nProvide your review in this exact format:\n\n```\n## R1 Review: Methods and Experiments\n\n### Summary\n[2-3 sentences]\n\n### Strengths\nS1. [strength]\nS2. [strength]\n...\n\n### Weaknesses\nW1. [weakness]\nW2. [weakness]\n...\n\n### Questions for Authors\nQ1. [question]\nQ2. [question]\n...\n\n### Detailed Comments\n[paragraph-level comments on specific sections]\n\n### Preliminary Scores\n- Soundness: [1-5]\n- Excitement: [1-5]\n- Reproducibility: [1-5]\n- Overall: [1-5, half-point scale]\n- Confidence: [1-5]\n```\n\nBe rigorous but fair. Calibrate to EMNLP acceptance rate (~21% main, ~30% findings).\n","uuid":"7237f9e1-c164-4f3d-8688-f4bba8ed504e","session_id":"2ca9953f-3689-48c5-81f7-171ddea5ca88"}
