{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QcDuemTVZMAaEPBgpKeVNW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\\section{Conclusion}\n2\t\n3\tPolicy ambiguity increases agent violations by 31.0\\,pp excluding incompleteness ($+$12.7\\,pp on SOPBench, 3/5 significant), with 95.4\\% overall disambiguation neglect and a type--mechanism dissociation ($V = 0.45$, LLM-coded) motivating clause-level policy auditing over type-level risk screening.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01JteALxo14kMNMigz3dUbcx","session_id":"2ca9953f-3689-48c5-81f7-171ddea5ca88","uuid":"a53ccf0d-aef1-467e-a81f-2ae2f23b44c1","timestamp":"2026-05-23T19:54:32.873Z"}
